{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52362","headline":"诗 六 · 王梵志","name":"诗 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俗人道我痴，我道俗人[騃]。\n两两相排拨，喽罗不可解。\n世人重荣华，我心今已罢。\n惟有如意珠，撩渠不肯买。\n耽浮[五]欲乐，几许难开解。\n（任录此下别作一首）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}